OpenFish v2.25.0 one-time Cloudflare Worker and frontend release marker.

This marker triggers only the Cloudflare Worker/static frontend deployment when
the approved v2.25.0 release is merged to main. The Cloud Run browser engine is
unchanged in this release and remains on its separately gated manual workflow,
which requires GCP Workload Identity and engine token secrets.

Do not edit or remove this marker after the Worker release; future Worker
releases must use a new versioned marker path.
